  ;; Self-trip-avoidance: every term above is phrased as the
  ;; finalization/execution ACTION, never a bare noun ("safety",
  ;; "hazmat", "hours of service", "clearance") -- this namespace's own
  ;; :flag-safety-concern default proposal legitimately discusses load-
  ;; securement/hazmat-placarding/hours-of-service concerns. A bare-noun
  ;; term list would self-trip this actor's own core happy path on every
  ;; single run (the exact known bug class multiple sibling agents in
  ;; this fleet independently discovered and fixed). Regression tests:
  ;; governor-test/default-mock-advisor-proposals-never-self-trip-scope-exclusion
  ;; and governor-test/out-of-scope-hook-does-trip-scope-exclusion (proves
  ;; the check is not a no-op).

